      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Social Metadata API",
      "Anchor": "social-metadata-api",
      "SectionPath": [],
      "Text": "The Feed Social Metadata API returns the social metadata for specific feed content. It supports urn:li:activity, urn:li:share, urn:li:ugcPost, urn:li:comment. These feed content items may have social actions such as reactions and comments attached to them. The socialMetadata API allows you to acquire a summary of these social actions on the content, both organic and sponsored.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Social Metadata API",
      "Anchor": "social-metadata-api",
      "SectionPath": [],
      "Text": "Example showing a LinkedIn post with social metadata including reactions (likes) and comments that can be retrieved via the Social Metadata API.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Social Metadata API",
      "Anchor": "social-metadata-api",
      "SectionPath": [],
      "Text": "The service currently provides the following methods:",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Social Metadata API",
      "Anchor": "social-metadata-api",
      "SectionPath": [],
      "Text": "BATCH_GET - List of Social Metadata for the given set of feed content with ids",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
